# .gitattributes for django-news-app
#
# Text files are stored with LF line endings, and checked out with LF on
# every system, including Windows. This overrides each person's own
# core.autocrlf setting, so the files are the same everywhere, and a
# shell script copied into a Docker image still runs on Linux. Git
# detects binary files itself and leaves them unchanged.
* text=auto eol=lf
